m\\in\\mathbb N:m\\ge n_0\\}\\;bf(n)\\le ag(n))\n\\to\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\nf,g\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}\\land\n(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\le f(n))\n\\land(\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:m\\ge n_0\\}\\;bf(n)\\le ag(n))\n\\to\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\land\n\\exists L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\;(L\\in\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\land L\\notin\\mathrm{SPACE}(f))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SPACE}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\land\n\\exists L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\;(L\\in\\mathrm{SPACE}(g)\\land L\\notin\\mathrm{SPACE}(f))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>这是旧目录的兼容接口。数字标签与 aliases 仅是本目录历史编号，不对应 1979 年原书的定理或定义编号；书源定位以 source_ref 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-space-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"8346a921772e7ddf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-space-complexity-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-work-space-hierarchy","status":"res